{"unit_id": "tag:062N:statement", "translation": "概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>上的向量丛（vector bundles）范畴（category）与拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0002>-模（modules）的范畴（category）反等价（equivalent）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "向量丛所基于的概形。"}, {"source_term": "vector bundles", "target_term": "向量丛", "context": "第一个范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指由向量丛构成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定第二个范畴中的模。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "第二个范畴的对象。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指由拟凝聚模构成的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "原文为 anti-equivalent，前缀 anti- 译为“反”，表示反变等价。"}], "notes": []}
